    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31b4402c06475d34a1abd467",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有石头做的房子，还有好大的神殿！\n我好开心，正想靠近的时候，\n突然出现一道闪闪亮亮的光──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddd053ba43fdafe9e0ca04dd5f93b7db64765473faee4b7e6056814235761ff9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055104.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        78,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/78/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a36464a21b2024bd2e430245",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然后等她回过神来，似乎人已经在海滩上了。\n无论如何，人没事真是太好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e718fbe777ba8676f1115740e3d4843f92263810cf7c0a5349d8072f6b741e98",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055104.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        79,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/79/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5194a29e2991bd48081b053",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "成田白仁在夏季发表复出消息后备受瞩目。\n周遭人们都在期待最强赛马娘的复活，\n气氛相当热烈──但是。",
      "source_fingerprint": "50f9352dce693648563551c622e7785a0ce12f01fb08a890906e32b1904d1de9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055104.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9ec56b19a12b98eca233c25",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "听说隔天志愿者潜入海中，\n在发现了疑似过去荒废的居住遗迹，\n在当地一带引起了短暂的骚动。",
      "source_fingerprint": "67c470bb2c6329aac2b9fbb2b9413128c6a5697688adfc3406c46822ad6172a1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055104.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        80,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/80/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e751b4f66317fc4baf38b05c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看起来比任何人都更关注成田白仁，\n特别留意她的两人，\n表情却……相当僵硬。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e73436c9612dbf2000cb91473fb2f5ec4a976b44b310e3c60af507c9f1b0138",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
